From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Patrick Quinn <patrick.jm.quinn@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 09:19:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] media: i2c: imx111: Fix the Bayer order of the unflipped
 readout

The format table lists the media bus codes in flip order (none, H, V,
H+V), but starts the cycle at GBRG. With no flip applied the IMX111
reads out RGGB, so every reported code was off by one flip and raw
captures demosaiced with swapped colours on the Zinwa Q25's front
camera. Rotate the table to start at RGGB and make the default format
match it.

Signed-off-by: Patrick Quinn <patrick.jm.quinn@gmail.com>
---
 drivers/media/i2c/imx111.c | 10 +++++-----
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/media/i2c/imx111.c b/drivers/media/i2c/imx111.c
index 8eb91978..073efc0f 100644
--- a/drivers/media/i2c/imx111.c
+++ b/drivers/media/i2c/imx111.c
@@ -218,15 +218,15 @@ static const struct imx111_pll imx111_pll[] = {
  * - h&v flips
  */
 static const u32 imx111_mbus_formats[] = {
-	MEDIA_BUS_FMT_SGBRG10_1X10,
-	MEDIA_BUS_FMT_SBGGR10_1X10,
 	MEDIA_BUS_FMT_SRGGB10_1X10,
 	MEDIA_BUS_FMT_SGRBG10_1X10,
+	MEDIA_BUS_FMT_SGBRG10_1X10,
+	MEDIA_BUS_FMT_SBGGR10_1X10,
 
-	MEDIA_BUS_FMT_SGBRG8_1X8,
-	MEDIA_BUS_FMT_SBGGR8_1X8,
 	MEDIA_BUS_FMT_SRGGB8_1X8,
 	MEDIA_BUS_FMT_SGRBG8_1X8,
+	MEDIA_BUS_FMT_SGBRG8_1X8,
+	MEDIA_BUS_FMT_SBGGR8_1X8,
 };
 
 static const struct cci_reg_sequence imx111_global_init[] = {
@@ -1195,7 +1195,7 @@ static int imx111_init_state(struct v4l2_subdev *sd,
 
 	fmt = v4l2_subdev_state_get_format(sd_state, 0);
 
-	fmt->code = MEDIA_BUS_FMT_SGBRG10_1X10;
+	fmt->code = MEDIA_BUS_FMT_SRGGB10_1X10;
 	fmt->width = mode->width;
 	fmt->height = mode->height;
 	fmt->field = V4L2_FIELD_NONE;
